    "requests": [
      {
        "key": "search",
        "method": "POST",
        "host": "www.xingtu.cn",
        "path": "/gw/api/gsearch/search_for_author_square",
        "request_match": {
          "search_param.keyword": "$keyword",
          "search_param.seach_type": "$keyword_mode",
          "page_param.page": "$cursor"
        },
        "response_match": {},
        "success_path": "base_resp.status_code",
        "success_value": "0",
        "error_codes": {
          "10003": "PLATFORM_PERMISSION_DENIED"
        }
      }
    ],
    "result_request_key": "search",
    "candidates_path": "authors",
    "id_path": "star_id",
    "homepage_path": null,
    "homepage_template": "https://www.xingtu.cn/ad/creator/author-homepage/douyin-video/{platform_creator_id}",
    "next_path": "pagination.page",
    "exhausted_path": "pagination.has_more",
    "exhausted_value": "false",
    "pagination": "page",
    "next_page_mode": "page_fetch",
    "page_fetch_max_verified": 2,
    "resume_supported": false,
    "initial_cursor": "1",
    "fixed_sort": true,
    "single_page_only": false,
    "binding_values": {
      "keyword_mode": {
        "content": "3"
      }
    },
    "coverage_gaps": [
      "页面 UI 滚动到底不产生下一页请求；已核验同一页面上下文复用原生请求头与请求体可取得 page=2。当前 page_fetch_max_verified=2，page=3 及以后和真实终点尚未核验，达到边界会以 SEARCH_CAPABILITY_LIMIT 停止而不报告平台耗尽",
      "response_match 为空：平台搜索响应不回显关键词/页码，请求归属只由方法/主机/路径+请求体绑定判定",
      "访问节奏未实测：action_interval_seconds=2.0 为保守值，平台限流阈值尚未核验",
      "筛选条件只核验了关键词(内容找人)；合作诉求/匹配度/性价比/主题推荐等筛选项的填写与回读未核验",
      "会话错误页只登记了空集：登录表单本身就是会话入口，无法用作失效判据；账号/受保护页面超时记 ACCOUNT_LOGIN_REQUIRED，安全挑战的具体选择器待核验",
      "ready_hidden 为空集：结果区加载提示定位未核验（候选 xt-loading__wrapper 在页面上有多处匹配，登记为必须消失会造成严格模式误判）"
    ]
  },
